An optional source field copied to a required target field: an instance that
lacks it would have nothing to put there.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	a: string
	b: int
	c: bool
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	tip: {
		c: true
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0343]: b is optional in v0.0 and required in tip
 --> tip.thema:3:2
  |
3 |     b: int
  |     ^
  |
  = help: write b: _coalesce(v0_0.b, <fallback>) to say what to use when it is absent
